---
title: Join the team
description: "Students in grades 7-12 can join Team 1102 in Aiken, SC. No experience needed. Here is who can join and when we meet."
permalink: /join/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Join the team</h1>
    <p>If you are curious about how things work, there is a place for you here. No experience needed.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>What to know first</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h3>Who can join</h3>
      <p>Students in grades 7 to 12 from anywhere in {{ site.region }}. You do not need to attend {{ site.school }}. Younger students can join our FIRST LEGO League team.</p>

      <h3>When and where we meet</h3>
      <p>At {{ site.school }}. The team meets year-round with short breaks. In the off-season, meetings are Tuesday and Thursday evenings.</p>

      <h3>What you will do</h3>
      <p>Pick a subteam that matches what you want to learn: Engineering, Manufacturing, Programming, Media and PR, or Business. Read about each one on the <a href="{{ '/programs/' | url }}">programs page</a>.</p>

      <h3>For parents and guardians</h3>
      <p>We use BAND to share announcements, schedules, and reminders with families. You will get an invitation once your student joins.</p>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.join }}"{% if links.joinIsForm %} rel="noopener" target="_blank"{% endif %}>{% if site.joinFormUrl %}Fill out the interest form{% else %}Email us to get started{% endif %}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--line" href="{{ '/faqs/' | url }}">Read the FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
